<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8262" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεμ-ώνη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>poppy anemone, Anemone coronaria,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				98
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				108.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.10.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἥμερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.176
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀγρία</span>
			<i>scarlet wind-flower, Anemone fulgens,</i> ibid.; also called 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φοινικῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crateuas
					<u>Fr.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λειμωνία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					6.8.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὀρεία,</span>
			<i>mountain wind-flower, Anemone blanda,</i> ibid.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα ῥόδον τίκτει, τὰ δὲ δάκρυα τὰν
					ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Bion
					1.66
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεμῶναι λόγων</span>
			<i>flowers</i> of speech (with suggestion of <i>emptiness</i>),
				<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
